             const float4 own = float4(dustHash(uint4(uint3(cell) ^ uint3(0x68E31DA4u, 0xB5297A4Du, 0x1B56C4E9u), j))) * (1.0f / 4294967295.0f);
             const float3 phase = h.xyz * 6.28318531f;
